# ============================================================
# Developer Logs & AI Artifacts (NEVER push to remote)
# ============================================================
# .dev-logs/ is local-only developer storage. It holds session
# history, pending tasks, roadmap notes, AI-generated artifacts,
# and scratch work. Nothing in this folder is pushable to remote.
